<h1 data-copy-en="Valkyra" data-copy-zh="Valkyra">Valkyra</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Valkyra’s combat lessons, daytime schedule, recruitment and Security Office activities." data-copy-zh="Valkyra的战斗教学、白天日程、招募与安保办公室活动。">Valkyra’s combat lessons, daytime schedule, recruitment and Security Office activities.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find Valkyra</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">Missing actions and useful checks</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">出现地点与时间</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">动作缺失时的检查</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Credits_and_Current_Scope"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Other_Shared_Appearances"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="All25_Shared_Island_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Sunset_Walk_with_Valkyra"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Sunset_Walk_Best_Replies"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Sirena_Isle_Daily_Activities"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Crafted_Training_Upgrades"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Side-Step_and_Sword_Stone_Bonding"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Optional_Higher-Point_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Off-Duty"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Security_Office_Conversation_and_Quiet_Hour"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Floor30_Recruitment"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Talk.2C_Combat_Lessons_and_Festival_Evening"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Talk,_Combat_Lessons_and_Festival_Evening"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Valkyra — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/valkyra.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Valkyra — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/valkyra.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Valkyra — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Valkyra offers early combat instruction and a festival date before her later Security Office activities. Recruitment adds an evening location while retaining her daytime guild and tournament appearances.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Stats_and_Schedule"></span><h2>Where to find Valkyra</h2><p>Meet her at Tournament Grounds on even days or Fighters Guild on odd days, 10:00–18:00. Win her ordinary dungeon floor-30 encounter to recruit her; the recruitment does not depend on an optional post-battle response.</p><p>After recruitment she also appears at the Security Office daily 18:00–04:00. The daytime portraits remain available.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Location</th><th scope="col">Portrait schedule</th><th scope="col">Condition</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Tournament Grounds</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">even days, 10:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Condition"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Fighters Guild</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">odd days, 10:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Condition"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Security Office</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">18:00–24:00; 00:00–04:00</td><td data-label="Condition">Valkyra recruited and active</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Windows refer to the time you start an action; the ending time is excluded.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Talk builds the relationship for her lessons. At Friend (100), Festival Evening starts from either daytime portrait 11:00–16:00, costs 120 minutes, $80 and 40 Energy, and completes once.</p><p>At Close Friend (200), Off-Duty becomes available at the Security Office for 60 minutes, 15 Energy and 5 Calm recovery. Quiet Hour is a separate optional activity at 1,200 relationship points.</p><details><summary>Automatic encounters: complete start conditions</summary><p>Enter the indicated location during its scene window. These encounters complete once; fixed base relationship rewards below are separate from choice bonuses. A missing hour restriction means the scene itself has no extra clock gate.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Encounter</th><th scope="col">Start location / hours</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Fixed base relationship</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">When Warriors Meet Chaos</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Rowdy Alehouse; 20:00–24:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Valkyra Acknowledged (10); Brandy Acknowledged (10); not vacationing: Brandy / Valkyra</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Valkyra +5 / Brandy +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Warrior's Honor</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Crafts and Jewelry Stall; 09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Valkyra Acknowledged (10); Rose &amp; Arthur Acknowledged (10); not vacationing: Valkyra</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">—</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Result / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Festival Evening</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Tournament Grounds; even days, 11:00–16:00<br/>Fighters Guild; odd days, 11:00–16:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; $80; −40 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Off-Duty</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Security Office; 18:00–24:00; 00:00–04:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend (200)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; −15 Energy; +5 Calm</td><td data-label="Result / limit">heart-to-heart; once</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Worker_Visits_and_Training"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><p>The four ordinary lessons teach Weapon Mastery, Defensive Stance, Power Strike and Swordplay. Each disappears once its skill is learned. Their skill-stat requirements apply alongside the relationship requirement and listed costs.</p><p>Combat Discipline grants Ability +1 and 10 direct relationship points once at Known (25) and Communication 65, for 30 minutes. Side-Step requires Romantic (800), Ability 60 and the corresponding content access: 350 minutes, 180 Energy and 100 Calm.</p><p>If you own Sword Stone, In Love (3000) opens Intimate Bonding at the Security Office: 60 minutes for stone level +1, once daily. Worker management, crafted upgrades and resort Sunset Walk are separate from the ordinary combat lessons.</p><p>Relationship rewards are base values unless marked direct. Shared relationship modifiers affect the final gain. Repeated actions keep their daily allowance when you meet the same character elsewhere.</p><details><summary>Relationship bonuses</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Type</th><th scope="col">Reference</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Favorite stats</th><td data-label="Reference">Strength 50 / Ability 55 / Stamina 60</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Relationship skill</th><td data-label="Reference">Exploit Weakness</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Favorite-stat contribution scales toward the listed values. The relationship skill affects the shared relationship multiplier; it is not automatically a skill taught by this character.</p></details><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Result / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Valkyra</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Tournament Grounds; even days, 10:00–18:00<br/>Fighters Guild; odd days, 10:00–18:00<br/>Security Office; 18:00–24:00; 00:00–04:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">base relationship +1; 4 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Weapon Mastery</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Tournament Grounds; even days, 10:00–18:00<br/>Fighters Guild; odd days, 10:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acknowledged (10); Ability 18</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">160 min; $500; −60 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">learn Weapon Mastery; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Defensive Stance</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Tournament Grounds; even days, 10:00–18:00<br/>Fighters Guild; odd days, 10:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acknowledged (10); Stamina 12</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">160 min; $500; −60 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">learn Defensive Stance; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Power Strike</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Tournament Grounds; even days, 10:00–18:00<br/>Fighters Guild; odd days, 10:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acknowledged (10); Strength 15</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">160 min; $500; −60 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">learn Power Strike; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Swordplay</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Tournament Grounds; even days, 10:00–18:00<br/>Fighters Guild; odd days, 10:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100); Ability 20</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">180 min; $1,000; −80 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">learn Swordplay; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Combat Discipline</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Tournament Grounds; even days, 10:00–18:00<br/>Fighters Guild; odd days, 10:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Known (25); Communication 65</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">30 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">Ability +1; direct relationship +10; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Quiet Hour</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Security Office; 18:00–24:00; 00:00–04:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">relationship 1200; corresponding content access</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; −40 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">1 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Side-Step</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Security Office; 18:00–24:00; 00:00–04:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Romantic (800); Ability 60; corresponding content access</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">350 min; −180 Energy; −100 Calm</td><td data-label="Result / limit">base relationship +30; 1 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Intimate Bonding</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Security Office; 18:00–24:00; 00:00–04:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">In Love (3000); own Sword Stone</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">Sword Stone level +1; once/day shared across locations</td></tr></tbody></table></div><details><summary>Heart-to-heart reward reference</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Conversation</th><th scope="col">Best ordinary base total</th><th scope="col">Useful special replies</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Off-Duty</th><td data-label="Best ordinary base total">49</td><td data-label="Useful special replies">round 1: Reading People (+2 base); round 3: Charm 50 (+1 base); round 4: Seduction (+1 base)</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>These totals describe the best ordinary choices, before relationship modifiers. A special reply can improve the reward; it is not required just to finish the conversation. Romantic adds 25 final relationship points on completion.</p></details></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="NPC_Intimacy_Gallery_and_Troubleshooting"></span><h2>Missing actions and useful checks</h2><p>Recruitment adds the office; it does not relocate her out of the guild/tournament schedule. Bring enough maximum Energy and Calm for Side-Step. Her learned Exploit Weakness relationship bonus is separate from the skills she teaches.</p></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><p><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Relationships, dates and intimacy</a> · <a href="game-systems-fighters-guild.html">Fighters Guild</a> · <a href="game-systems-brothel.html">Brothel operations</a> · <a href="game-systems-soul-stones.html">Soul Stones</a> · <a href="game-systems-sirena-isle-resort.html">Sirena Isle Resort</a></p></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Credits_and_Current_Scope"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Other_Shared_Appearances"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-All25_Shared_Island_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sunset_Walk_with_Valkyra"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sunset_Walk_Best_Replies"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sirena_Isle_Daily_Activities"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Crafted_Training_Upgrades"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Side-Step_and_Sword_Stone_Bonding"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Optional_Higher-Point_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Off-Duty"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Security_Office_Conversation_and_Quiet_Hour"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Floor30_Recruitment"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Talk.2C_Combat_Lessons_and_Festival_Evening"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Talk,_Combat_Lessons_and_Festival_Evening"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Valkyra 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/valkyra.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Valkyra 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/valkyra.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Valkyra 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Valkyra前期提供战斗教学与节庆约会，后续还有安保办公室活动。招募会增加晚间地点，同时保留白天的公会和锦标赛场地日程。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Stats_and_Schedule"></span><h2>出现地点与时间</h2><p>双数日到锦标赛场地、单数日到战士公会，时间均为10:00—18:00。在普通地下城第30层赢下她的遭遇后即可招募，不需要选择某个可选的战后回应。</p><p>招募后，她每天18:00—次日04:00也会出现在安保办公室，白天头像仍然保留。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">头像出现时间</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">锦标赛场地</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">双数日，10:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">战士公会</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">单数日，10:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">安保办公室</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">18:00–24:00；00:00–04:00</td><td data-label="条件">Valkyra已招募且启用</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>时段按开始动作时判定，结束时间不包含在内。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>可以靠交谈培养教学所需关系。达到朋友（100）后，节庆之夜可从任一白天头像于11:00—16:00开始，消耗120分钟、80财富、40精力，一次性完成。</p><p>亲密朋友（200）后，可在安保办公室进行休班时光，消耗60分钟、15精力，恢复5镇定。安静一小时是另一项可选活动，要求1,200点关系。</p><details><summary>展开自动事件的完整开始条件</summary><p>在事件时段进入指定地点即可触发。均为一次性事件，下列固定基础关系奖励与选择奖励另算；未列额外时段表示事件本身不再加设时间限制。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">事件</th><th scope="col">开始地点／时间</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">固定基础关系奖励</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">当战士遇上混乱</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">喧闹酒馆; 20:00–24:00</td><td data-label="条件">Valkyra 已遇见（10）；Brandy 已遇见（10）；未在度假：Brandy、Valkyra</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Valkyra +5、Brandy +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">战士的敬意</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">工艺品与珠宝摊; 09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="条件">Valkyra 已遇见（10）；Rose &amp; Arthur 已遇见（10）；未在度假：Valkyra</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">—</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">动作</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">结果／限制</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">节庆之夜</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">锦标赛场地; 双数日，11:00–16:00<br/>战士公会; 单数日，11:00–16:00</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120分钟；财富80；−40 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">休班时光</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">安保办公室; 18:00–24:00；00:00–04:00</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（200）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60分钟；−15 精力；+5 镇定</td><td data-label="结果／限制">谈心，一次性</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Worker_Visits_and_Training"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><p>四项普通教学分别教授武器精通、防御姿态、强力打击和剑术，学会对应技能后不再提供。技能自身的属性要求，也要与关系门槛及表中消耗一同满足。</p><p>战斗纪律要求已知（25）、沟通65，花30分钟，一次性给予能力+1和10点直接关系。侧步要求浪漫感（800）、能力60和相应内容访问权限，消耗350分钟、180精力、100镇定。</p><p>持有剑石并达到恋爱中（3000）后，可在安保办公室进行亲密羁绊：60分钟增加一级灵魂石，每日一次。员工管理、制作训练升级和度假日落漫步，都与普通战斗教学分开。</p><p>除注明直接增加外，关系奖励均为基础值，最终增量受共通关系修正影响。同一角色换地点不会重置重复动作的每日额度。</p><details><summary>展开关系加成参考</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">类别</th><th scope="col">参考</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">偏好属性</th><td data-label="参考">力量 50、能力 55、耐力 60</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">关系加成技能</th><td data-label="参考">利用弱点</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>偏好属性的加成随数值提高，逐步达到所列参考值。关系加成技能影响共通关系倍率，不代表该角色一定负责教授这项技能。</p></details><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">动作</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">结果／限制</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">和 Valkyra 交谈</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">锦标赛场地; 双数日，10:00–18:00<br/>战士公会; 单数日，10:00–18:00<br/>安保办公室; 18:00–24:00；00:00–04:00</td><td data-label="条件">陌生人（0）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">15分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">基础关系+1；4次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">武器精通</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">锦标赛场地; 双数日，10:00–18:00<br/>战士公会; 单数日，10:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">已遇见（10）；能力18</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">160分钟；财富500；−60 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">学会武器精通；20次／日安全额度；一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">防御姿态</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">锦标赛场地; 双数日，10:00–18:00<br/>战士公会; 单数日，10:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">已遇见（10）；耐力12</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">160分钟；财富500；−60 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">学会防御姿态；20次／日安全额度；一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">强力打击</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">锦标赛场地; 双数日，10:00–18:00<br/>战士公会; 单数日，10:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">已遇见（10）；力量15</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">160分钟；财富500；−60 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">学会强力打击；20次／日安全额度；一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">剑术</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">锦标赛场地; 双数日，10:00–18:00<br/>战士公会; 单数日，10:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）；能力20</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">180分钟；财富1,000；−80 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">学会剑术；20次／日安全额度；一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">战斗纪律</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">锦标赛场地; 双数日，10:00–18:00<br/>战士公会; 单数日，10:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">已知（25）；沟通65</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">30分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">能力 +1；直接关系+10；一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">安静一小时</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">安保办公室; 18:00–24:00；00:00–04:00</td><td data-label="条件">关系点数1200；相应内容访问权限</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60分钟；−40 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">1次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">侧步</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">安保办公室; 18:00–24:00；00:00–04:00</td><td data-label="条件">浪漫感（800）；能力60；相应内容访问权限</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">350分钟；−180 精力；−100 镇定</td><td data-label="结果／限制">基础关系+30；1次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">亲密羁绊</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">安保办公室; 18:00–24:00；00:00–04:00</td><td data-label="条件">恋爱中（3000）；持有剑石</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">剑石等级+1；各地点共用每日一次额度</td></tr></tbody></table></div><details><summary>展开谈心奖励参考</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">谈心</th><th scope="col">最佳普通选择基础总值</th><th scope="col">实用特殊回复条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">休班时光</th><td data-label="最佳普通选择基础总值">49</td><td data-label="实用特殊回复条件">第1轮: 识人术（+2基础点）; 第3轮: 魅力 50（+1基础点）; 第4轮: 诱惑（+1基础点）</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>总值为普通选项的最佳基础合计，尚未套用关系修正。特殊回复可提高奖励，但不是完成谈心的必要条件；学会浪漫后，完成时另加25点最终关系。</p></details></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-NPC_Intimacy_Gallery_and_Troubleshooting"></span><h2>动作缺失时的检查</h2><p>招募是增加办公室，不会移除公会与锦标赛场地的日程。侧步教学消耗很高，请先准备足够的精力、镇定上限。已学会的利用弱点是关系加成，和她负责教授的技能不同。</p></section>
